# {{.ExportedName}}

A go-sicky MCP server project.

## Getting Started

```bash
make build
make run
```

## MCP Configuration

```json
{
    "mcpServers": {
        "{{.Name}}": {
            "command": "./bin/svc"
        }
    }
}
```

## Project Structure

```
{{.Name}}/
  main.go        # Entry point
  config.go      # Configuration struct
  config.json    # Default configuration
  handler/       # MCP handlers
  tool/          # Tool definitions
  resource/      # Resource definitions
  Makefile       # Build targets
```
